{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muni\u2019s life is no picnic. She spends her days at a dull job, occasionally thinking back to her old school friend Terra, and returns each night to a husband she no longer loves. Things go from bad to worse when her boss starts taking out his frustrations on her for no reason, and her best employee is transferred to another department.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there\u2019s Tayo \u2014 a new waitress at the caf\u00e9 Muni often visits \u2014 who stirs things up even more. This catgirl is insufferable, yet behind her hyperactive personality lies a remarkable gift for winning anyone over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new chapter of her life, Muni will have to make difficult choices and discover sides of herself she never knew existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual Novel, ADV, romance, yuri, drama, comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >three love interests; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple endings;  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >romantic and erotic scenes.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1479970?t=1770842636","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1479970?t=1770842636","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1479970/3343dc1a4074a2b830def8f852d73e2516fa8ed5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770842636","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1479970/3343dc1a4074a2b830def8f852d73e2516fa8ed5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770842636","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_de